<title>USA: Suzuki November US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Suzuki November US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suzuki Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Nov 1-30, 1996     Nov 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		 491		 331	    +48.3</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	     644		 863	    -25.4</p>
<p> Import Car		   715		 529	    +35.2</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,115	     1,214	     -8.2</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Nov 30, 1996 Jan 1-Nov 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     3,328	     3,659	     -9.7</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  10,858	    12,595	    -14.4</p>
<p> Import Car		 5,984	     3,699	    +60.6</p>
<p> Import Truck	    14,104	    10,281	    +36.2</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 283 for year to date vs 281 in year ago.</p>
</text>
